isability.\nAnswer _______________________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1071, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Minimising the risk of deficit and in detecting early signs of the development.\nAnswer ______________________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1149, "answer": {"text": "D", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": ".At risk of death from a relatively simple transverse fracture of the tibia, if it is\nnot detected.", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1264, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 8, "prompt": ".What can be provided for effective pain management?\nAnswer ________________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 449, "answer": {"text": "Pre-emptive analgesia", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 9, "prompt": "When can it be possible to make the patient ready for movement?\nAnswer __________________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 530, "answer": {"text": "After healing", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "What should not be regarded as the unavoidable part of recovery from injury?\nAnswer __________________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 625, "answer": {"text": "Pain", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-libr