"kind": "question", "offset": 375, "answer": {"text": "mal-union", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 17, "prompt": "There are _____________ that carry the risk of damage to particular arteries.", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 512, "answer": {"text": "several injuries", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 18, "prompt": "Pain is considered a ___________ which make one aware of the injury.", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 595, "answer": {"text": "useful sensation", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 19, "prompt": "A ______________ is an uncommon but serious complication.", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 669, "answer": {"text": "fat embolism", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 20, "prompt": "Besides the blood loss from the______________, the sharp bone ends found in\na spiral or comminuted fracture, for example, may damage the surrounding muscle\nor blood vessels.\nPart B", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": ["A"], "kind": "question", "offset": 732, "answer": {"text": "fractured bone", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}, {"id": "459e1012639f5829-p6", "label": "Part A · In this part of the test, there are six short extracts relating to the work of health", "part": "A", "sourceSha256": "459e1012639f5829d7ed866a4536f01f80889b4d8a706a210219d49f6cbba9b7", "pages": [6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": ".The following is a ______ model\nManual calibration\nTrue gravity calibration\nWall sphygmomanometer\nMercury-gravity Manometer\nThe mercury-gravity manometer consists of a calibrated cartridge glass tube that is\noptically clear, easy to clean, and abrasion resistant. The mercury reservoir at the\nbottom of the tube communicates with a compression cuff through a rubber tube.\nWhen air pressure is exerted on the mercury in the reservoir by pumping the\npressure bulb, the mercury in the glass tube rises and indicates how much pressure\nthe cuff applies against the artery. The manometer is connected to the wall for ease\nof accurate visualization.", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 215, "answer": {"text": "D", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": ".The manual gives information about;", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 882, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655