1aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 9, "prompt": "What do we learn about OIC in the third paragraph?\nResearch conducted by Bell\nImpact of OIC on life\nHow OIC will affect?\nCessation of opioid pain therapy", "sourcePage": 17, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 22, "answer": {"text": "Impact of OIC on life", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 10, "prompt": ".What do we learn from the fourth paragraph?\nOpioid acceptance behaviour among patients\nAbility to deal with the analgesic effects\nResilience and OIC\nOpioid Tolerance and OIC", "sourcePage": 17, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 200, "answer": {"text": "Opioid Tolerance and OIC", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 11, "prompt": "What is not right as per the information given in the fifth paragraph?\nA large number of symptoms arises that lead to OIC.\nDetection of bowel sounds, presence of nausea are common.\nPatients suffering from the disease will vomit, feel abdominal pain.\nNone of the above", "sourcePage": 17, "choices": ["A"], "kind": "question", "offset": 399, "answer": {"text": "None of the above", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 12, "prompt": "In paragraph six, the writer gives information on;", "sourcePage": 17, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 695, "answer": {"text": "Nonpharmacologic management of OIC.", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 15, "prompt": "In the first paragraph, writer says that;\nCombination vaccines are the new phase of development.\nVaccines implemented have changed lives of people across the globe.\nVaccines provide effective protection from a large number of pathogens c.\nUse of vaccines have led to curtailing down of deaths in millions.", "sourcePage": 19, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 0, "answer": {"text": "Vaccines implemented have changed lives of people across the globe.", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 16, "prompt": "In paragraph 2, the writer says\nCombination vaccines came into being in 1940s.\nDPT was the first combined vaccine to be used.\nOPV was not introduced before 1963.\nMMR is an example of effective combined vaccine.", "sourcePage": 19, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 331, "answer": {"text": "MMR is an example of effective combined vaccine.", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 20, "prompt": ".As per paragraph five, what is more relevant?\nDPT/Conjugate (Hib) will often be not more effective.\nCombined vaccines often produce different results.\nDPT/IPV came into being only after potency IPV became available.\nDPT/Hepatitis B and DPT/Hepatitis B/Hib have more potential to produce\nsame results", "sourcePage": 20, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 295, "answer": {"text": "Combined vaccines often produce different results.", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 21, "prompt": "In paragraph 6, the writer says;\nTaking vaccines at an early age is important.\nVarious combinations bring in various results.\nCombinations with DTaP is proven to be more effective\nSeparate vaccine shall be given as needed", "sourcePage": 20, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 619, "answer": {"text": ": Various combinations bring in various results.", "source": {"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-4e21aadec6574db655dc", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 4.pdf", "sha256": "4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/4e21aadec6574db655dcb06463c588dbaa2b7fff60a1835803c4f9ef8b8aba81.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}], "passages": []}]}
